<p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.969" end="00:24.329"><span begin="00:21.969" end="00:22.525">He </span><span begin="00:22.525" end="00:22.777">hit </span><span begin="00:22.777" end="00:22.989">the </span><span begin="00:22.989" end="00:23.249">stage </span><span begin="00:23.249" end="00:23.457">so </span><span begin="00:23.457" end="00:23.685">full </span><span begin="00:23.685" end="00:23.893">of </span><span begin="00:23.893" end="00:24.321">rage</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.029" end="00:26.001"><span begin="00:24.029" end="00:24.541">And </span><span begin="00:24.541" end="00:24.757">let </span><span begin="00:24.757" end="00:24.949">the </span><span begin="00:24.949" end="00:25.117">whole </span><span begin="00:25.117" end="00:25.265">world </span><span begin="00:25.265" end="00:25.409">know </span><span begin="00:25.409" end="00:25.996">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.701" end="00:27.833"><span begin="00:25.701" end="00:26.184">Six </span><span begin="00:26.184" end="00:26.349">feet </span><span begin="00:26.349" end="00:26.765">away  </span><span begin="00:26.765" end="00:26.953">they </span><span begin="00:26.953" end="00:27.166">heard </span><span begin="00:27.166" end="00:27.377">him </span><span begin="00:27.377" end="00:27.824">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.533" end="00:31.289"><span begin="00:27.533" end="00:28.053">“</span><span begin="00:28.053" end="00:28.245">Oh </span><span begin="00:28.245" end="00:28.421">God  </span><span begin="00:28.421" end="00:28.569">don</span><span begin="00:28.569" end="00:28.713">'</span><span begin="00:28.713" end="00:28.846">t </span><span begin="00:28.846" end="00:28.986">let </span><span begin="00:28.986" end="00:29.133">him </span><span begin="00:29.133" end="00:29.273">pull </span><span begin="00:29.273" end="00:29.429">it</span><span begin="00:29.429" end="00:31.280">”</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.989" end="00:34.893"><span begin="00:30.989" end="00:31.489">Please </span><span begin="00:31.489" end="00:31.769">God  </span><span begin="00:31.769" end="00:32.021">don</span><span begin="00:32.021" end="00:32.213">'</span><span begin="00:32.213" end="00:32.377">t </span><span begin="00:32.377" end="00:32.553">let </span><span begin="00:32.553" end="00:32.701">him </span><span begin="00:32.701" end="00:32.857">pull </span><span begin="00:32.857" end="00:34.886">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.593" end="00:38.523"><span begin="00:34.593" end="00:35.083">How </span><span begin="00:35.083" end="00:35.257">could </span><span begin="00:35.257" end="00:35.429">you </span><span begin="00:35.429" end="00:35.610">put </span><span begin="00:35.610" end="00:35.855">us </span><span begin="00:35.855" end="00:36.053">through </span><span begin="00:36.053" end="00:38.520">it </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.223" end="00:42.145"><span begin="00:38.223" end="00:38.721">His </span><span begin="00:38.721" end="00:38.923">brother </span><span begin="00:38.923" end="00:39.129">watched </span><span begin="00:39.129" end="00:39.396">you </span><span begin="00:39.396" end="00:39.601">do </span><span begin="00:39.601" end="00:42.137">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.845" end="00:44.492"><span begin="00:41.845" end="00:42.333">How </span><span begin="00:42.333" end="00:42.549">could </span><span begin="00:42.549" end="00:42.777">you </span><span begin="00:42.777" end="00:42.991">take </span><span begin="00:42.991" end="00:43.203">his </span><span begin="00:43.203" end="00:43.431">life </span><span begin="00:43.431" end="00:44.488">away </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.406" end="00:49.255"><span begin="00:45.406" end="00:45.926">How </span><span begin="00:45.926" end="00:46.206">could </span><span begin="00:46.206" end="00:46.609">you </span><span begin="00:46.609" end="00:46.796">be </span><span begin="00:46.796" end="00:46.986">so </span><span begin="00:46.986" end="00:47.201">full </span><span begin="00:47.201" e